<title>PORTUGAL: Yield falls on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Yield falls on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management auction of 25 billion escudos of five-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY: March 2002</p>
<p>AMOUNT PLACED: 25 bln esc	 COUPON: 5.75</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.61115</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 5.62 LOWEST: 5.55</p>
<p>BIDS: 65.4 bln esc PAYMENT FREQUENCY: Annual</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
